Subject: [PATCH] Record universal APK validation


diff --git a/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv b/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
index 98dd025c688d96d19c8d0e0a69d93022f74f8c0a..1a109f57f40f589fbfd15f50123063d80c5c9991 100644
--- a/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
+++ b/.audit/j2k-reset.tsv
@@ -64,3 +64,4 @@ ts	phase	decision	why	evidence	result
 2026-08-21T22:16:00Z	independent-review	resolved all three medium findings without adding a protected J2K seam	used J2K's existing public tracker helper and kept E-Hentai retry state plus tracker protocol validation in Hayai-owned modules	.audit/final-parity-review.md; commits 7027b48e05 and 6cc6c5d7fa	IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED
 2026-08-21T22:22:00Z	post-review-validation	compiled the integrated app and ran 31 tracker and gallery-updater regression tests with one Gradle worker	confirmed the review fixes compile and pass while the protected lifecycle and image-reader boundary remains untouched	gradlew --no-daemon --no-parallel --max-workers=1 :app:compileDevDebugKotlin :app:testDevDebugUnitTest --tests novel.tracker.* --tests adult.eh.update.* -x :app:formatKotlin	VERIFIED
 2026-08-21T22:35:00Z	javascript-runtime	unified J2K extension evaluation and Hayai novel plugins on one QuickJS implementation	two incompatible dependencies packaged the same native libquickjs.so path and made every APK variant unassemblable	JavaScriptEngine.kt; HayaiJavaScriptEvaluator.kt; app/build.gradle.kts	IMPLEMENTED_UNVERIFIED
+2026-08-21T23:47:00Z	apk-validation	assembled the universal dev-debug APK and verified its v2 debug signature	proved the unified JavaScript runtime packages successfully with no duplicate native library	gradlew --no-daemon --no-parallel --max-workers=1 :app:assembleDevDebug -x :app:formatKotlin; apksigner verify	VERIFIED
diff --git a/.audit/parity-completion.tsv b/.audit/parity-completion.tsv
index 174a8269e8213b9afa4debeec37fcb6eb0a5ba54..89f45f0b11d1b3d2883ffe09bb031497e499d17e 100644
--- a/.audit/parity-completion.tsv
+++ b/.audit/parity-completion.tsv
@@ -13,3 +13,4 @@ ts	phase	decision	why	evidence	result
 2026-08-21T22:16:00Z	independent-review	resolved all three medium findings from the read-only GPT-5.4 review	reader-driven tracker sync, retryable gallery 404 state, and remotely verified tracker credentials were required for honest parity	.audit/final-parity-review.md; commits 7027b48e05 and 6cc6c5d7fa	implemented-pending-regression-validation
 2026-08-21T22:17:00Z	emulator-gate	refused to run the authenticated workflow on the only installed general-purpose AVD	the harness requires a dedicated AVD containing Hayai and Test plus an external test-account file; Pixel_10_Pro_XL does not satisfy that safety boundary	tools/verify-hayai-emulator.ps1	blocked-by-dedicated-test-environment
 2026-08-21T22:22:00Z	post-review-validation	compiled the integrated app and ran the tracker and gallery-updater regression suites with one Gradle worker	verified all three independent-review fixes without repeating the full already-passing parity suite	gradlew --no-daemon --no-parallel --max-workers=1 :app:compileDevDebugKotlin :app:testDevDebugUnitTest --tests novel.tracker.* --tests adult.eh.update.* -x :app:formatKotlin	verified-31-tests
+2026-08-21T23:47:00Z	apk	assembled and signature-verified a universal dev-debug APK after unifying the QuickJS native runtime	the first packaging attempt exposed two incompatible libquickjs.so inputs; the corrected build contains one runtime and passed APK Signature Scheme v2 verification	app/build/outputs/apk/dev/debug/app-dev-universal-debug.apk; commit b6197a941d	verified
